{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7abf276ce8e8b874db0ff301144b2735bb641f582a43ada2d3e5933a0143a0c5", "ja": "『LOVERS HEART』のメンバーに\n選ばれた朋花、やよい、百合子、美奈子。\n二次元と三次元の恋を歌った新曲に百合子は\n興奮するが、やよいはピンと来ない様子。\nレッスン後、ゲームの勉強会を開くことに。", "zh": "被选为“LOVERS HEART”成员的\n朋花、弥生、百合子和美奈子。\n面对歌唱二次元与三次元恋情的新歌，\n百合子兴奋不已，弥生却似乎摸不着头脑。\n于是在练习结束后，大家决定开一场游戏学习会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af390cde06637ff69518eb473cb55c55aefcd4dffa196d8fe4d967f0aa81d6b8", "ja": "（早速新曲を歌ってもらうメンバーに招集をかけた。\nみんなもう集まってるかな……？）", "zh": "（马上召集了要为新歌演唱的成员。\n大家应该都已经到了吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "0ed6c3decacca233bb1dd25dc2fe47598a601c0cf6f95a56075c212a2a15e6db", "ja": "うう……。やっぱりそわそわしちゃう……！\nひとまず深呼吸をして……すう、はあ……。", "zh": "呜呜……还是静不下心来……！\n先深呼吸一下……吸——呼——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "6b2e1012e06309ea48c8638cfa001b527a4e1ff349e018ed3b983eed858770a9", "ja": "百合子ちゃん、さっきから落ち着かない\nみたいだけど……どうしたの？", "zh": "百合子从刚才开始就一直坐立不安的样子……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "063fce09baae64dcef3d8d9d628888e758fc01d751df38bf65f97e33b4ba9934", "ja": "き、緊張しちゃって……だってミリオンシアター\nシーズン、ついに私達の出番なんですから！", "zh": "因、因为太紧张了……毕竟百万剧场季终于轮到我们登场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "988bf0d0a6aef43c40eb5994ab2d65dca52e2aea521900ec70a7062272daec98", "ja": "はわっ！？　今日のミーティングって、\nそうだったんですか？", "zh": "哈！？今天的会议原来是为了这个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "81140a24452cb6354264bc4d4fbaf40edd0c0ec1f9eef12af95d012643f1dab4", "ja": "はっきり聞いたわけではありませんが……\n可能性は高いと思いますよ～。", "zh": "虽然没有听到明确的说法……不过我觉得可能性很高哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "f673783fccfd9392f25560f82f5c830b0a755de1dccccc36816bb6a2d2a3be8a", "ja": "今日集められた4人とも、ダイヤにもクローバーにも\n選ばれていないメンバーですから～。", "zh": "因为今天召集来的4个人，也都是没有被选进钻石组或梅花组的成员～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "731f86b2a131440ae05c3073c4b2a85671a61dc68f9fb7f22311c806d2572a1e", "ja": "あ、そういえばそうだね！　ということは……\nこの4人で新曲を歌うことになるのかな？", "zh": "啊，说起来确实是这样呢！也就是说……\n要由我们这4个人来演唱新歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "2a96fb50394c7fcae9edcf9b601a1c0837436452e03bc1bed9930eca66659e8b", "ja": "新曲……！　そう考えたら、\n私もなんだかそわそわしてきたかも……！？", "zh": "新歌……！这么一想，\n我好像也有点坐立不安了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "b96e0eba682323176939c4c240595a720e6332e3139a194156c0adb0c49a02e0", "ja": "私達はもはや運命共同体……！\n私、ちょっと顔を洗って精神統一をしてきます！", "zh": "我们如今已经是命运共同体了……！我先去洗把脸，调整一下精神状态！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1045_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9721dfa06afd8775a81e2a5b4075fcc44dfea26fdd8e4ef86ea14834345edddd", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\nもう全員揃って……おっと！", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n人都已经到齐了啊……哎哟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "aa430f3969453ff929867980b2de00d2945a57c6c4fed7697a5d33d1d8c00850", "ja": "きゃっ！？", "zh": "呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "da3baab9d763e6ae21cd039b90c75eef47e55b2d5244c66b01d96a563981e679", "ja": "ごめんごめん、百合子。\nしりもちついてるけど、ケガはないか？", "zh": "对不起，对不起，百合子。\n虽然你摔了个屁股蹲，但没受伤吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "b339217bf0cf038da268e653472b1a21bdccb5cfffb05ec276a2c3818a3866f9", "ja": "！？　顔が近……！　{$P$}さん、\n私の心を、これ以上乱さないでください～！？", "zh": "！？　脸、脸靠得好近……！　{$P$}先生，\n请不要再扰乱我的心了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "f691c6f335b27f1863d8f7746096230584303b03c8b3620019e777654813eb9a", "ja": "そういうわけで、ミーティング内容を予想してたん\nです。みんな想像が膨らんじゃって……。", "zh": "所以说，我就猜了猜会议的内容。结果大家都开始展开想象了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ef09132f2ecb1eb1cc8c9bcf6baec75f63aa22e28b279b8763e975a1e9374d42", "ja": "はは、期待してくれてたってことか。予想通り、\nみんながLOVERS HEARTのメンバーだ！", "zh": "哈哈，原来你们一直期待着啊。正如预想的那样，大家都是LOVERS HEART的成员！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cc2c5684c48d0845e1b3df16acab9c950befa1d7afa3f5c76b9200208e5594d5", "ja": "詳しい説明会は今度やるけど、先に新曲の話をしよう\nと思って。出来たてのデモ、すぐ聞きたいだろ？", "zh": "详细的说明会下次再开，不过我想先聊聊新曲的事。刚出炉的小样，你们肯定迫不及待想听吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "1472fe41c96ccbfd4ee5d6fb7f619d3eaaab2e53a5e970fd2b4d8210d906bb3c", "ja": "えっ！　もう新曲出来てるんですか！？\n今すぐ聞きたいですー！", "zh": "诶！新歌已经做好了吗！？\n我现在就想听——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e4ea20cd5f3bd344b7c7110d5d34adf4e9f799d4d5b038e782856275cb9af016", "ja": "そう来ると思ったよ。\n早速流すから、イメージを掴んでもらおう！", "zh": "我就知道你会这么说。\n马上播放给你听，先感受一下整体感觉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "43711cb3222bd9574040a50cb5e4294b48d3e0167f8277ba78bc471ab233992a", "ja": "か、かわいい～！　それと、なんだか\nゲームの音楽っぽい感じがするかも……？", "zh": "好、好可爱～！而且总觉得，好像有种\n游戏音乐的感觉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "64ebcfe5e93e955fca5a7b7de5ae939da6cf478defd5d903b78dd704ca3f7451", "ja": "いいところに気付いたな。昔のゲームサウンドを\nモチーフにした、いわゆるチップチューンなんだ。", "zh": "注意到好地方了呢。这是以以前的游戏音效为\n主题，也就是所谓的芯片音乐（Chiptune）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "4795c5039578bc917142ea8d2e8df42242f1d53c740c469d765c11020eebd966", "ja": "歌詞の内容はラブソングですね～。\nいわゆる、叶わない恋というか……。", "zh": "歌词的内容是情歌呢～。\n也可以说是，无法实现的恋爱……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "2e609301f274020270e092256ba7a804223824ef28a9ef50d894936f16c0d80b", "ja": "二次元と三次元の恋の歌だなんて……！\nそんなの、素敵過ぎますよね！？", "zh": "竟然是关于二次元和三次元之间恋爱的歌曲……！\n这也太美好了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "2bb95b86580937c6587f1a517e2a19ce9e4de13ae2ed02bc3b0042e897a075e1", "ja": "二次元と三次元の……恋？", "zh": "二次元和三次元的……恋爱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "0a798eaf7251093bb9268b2583def5aea6cd46fb09a3f064bb74799864831832", "ja": "はい！　画面越しの、決して結ばれないと\nわかっているからこその、切なさというか……！", "zh": "是的！就是那种隔着屏幕，明知道彼此绝不可能在一起才会有的……心酸感吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "c97e8d8e6876b6e461576ebbc089996eb377478ae49e661294d264ea7c04b3e3", "ja": "画面越し……？　現実にいない人を、\n好きになるんですか？", "zh": "隔着屏幕……？　会喜欢上现实中不存在的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "ec237853c4f4569715ffa7a0350e93bd22e143b292c502af60370afedfdad286", "ja": "いないけど、いるんです！　ゲームを通して、\n私にいろんな反応を返してくれたりとか……。", "zh": "虽然不在，但又确实存在！比如会透过游戏，\n对我做出各种各样的回应之类的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "88237aa9f1b8f11242375a5341fe6fad75a351d29cfd8734856976560c646a15", "ja": "敵を倒して冒険したり、遊園地でデートしたり、\nその時の共有してる気持ちは、本当で……！", "zh": "一起打倒敌人去冒险、一起在游乐园约会，\n那个时候彼此分享的心情，都是货真价实的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "644b53254413615a00dc32cf778a37ee7522f42f9ff82711fe850662be4ee290", "ja": "ゲームなんだけど、ほんとう……？\nう～ん……？", "zh": "虽然是游戏，但真的……？\n唔～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "1eac3491787038a5876bbfa095809380d87568f9cd2596060b35c8b7aee9e8fa", "ja": "確かに、馴染みがないと、ちょっと\n理解しづらいジャンルかもしれないな。", "zh": "确实，如果不太熟悉的话，这个类型可能会有点难理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1032_005yay", "source_sha256": "03dd9e88553694045a089bd4880823cad38089ab92b5409610e1a35a27683083", "ja": "ピコピコ鳴ってる音はかわいいと思うんですけど……\n内容は、ちょっと難しいかも……。", "zh": "我觉得哔哩哔哩响个不停的声音很可爱，但是……\n内容可能有点难懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1033_031tom", "source_sha256": "7507420933f7c045384fbe7f8939826a30ea1dbdf46e97ea8572d3ad451ba4c0", "ja": "存在は知っていますが、\n私もあまり触れてこなかった文化ですね～。", "zh": "虽然我知道它的存在，\n但也是我平时不太接触的文化呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "5d8fc46b72283be90df6cffb6d7b16b0c82f666e862d239f0439ceb91de56712", "ja": "私は格闘ゲームならよくプレイするんだけど、\n恋愛のゲームは全然で……。", "zh": "我平时很爱玩格斗游戏，但恋爱游戏就完全不玩……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "c44036d1f09cd920c7544be33611f3f3f781a508c5d2bd09869c108ca5cd0912", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。多くの人に、この曲の\n素晴らしさを伝えるためには、どうしたら……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……要怎样才能让更多人感受到这首歌的美妙呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "871054a079e9766b5bc2603a24e014fedc9624107bf00159e2f51cd9edcf6639", "ja": "わかりました！　みなさんの理解を\n深めるため……ここは私が一肌脱ぎます！", "zh": "明白了！为了让大家更深入地理解这首歌……这次就由我来助一臂之力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "3b5426d411b0462b8698f57e09db5a33485385cd3bd1ae9de001f411ba6a81b1", "ja": "……なんかこの流れ、前にもあったな。\nあの時みたいに小説を書くのは、ちょっと……。", "zh": "……总觉得这情形以前也发生过。\n要像那时候一样写小说，还是有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1038_026yur", "source_sha256": "9ab1a8837972a15991d1f33f23d0de2fd0d367f0af12ff8f2292e927cb961b63", "ja": "大丈夫です！　今回は方向性を変えて……！\n……。………………。", "zh": "没问题的！这次我会换个方向……！\n……。………………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1039_026yur", "source_sha256": "d03f605c82dd153f92a87c784fd723ce0ba9845e101a9047920bbe5bd8b0eee3", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n今回、どうしたらいいと思いますか……？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n这次，您觉得该怎么办才好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "cdada5c224267358bf6b962955aa173a7af931a87c0aeca9fbee48c4e74d9963", "ja": "思いつかなかったか……。まあ、レッスン後に\nゲームの勉強会でいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "没想到吗……也是，在课程结束后\n开个游戏研讨会不就好了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "e86e2c48ca780bd17aeefee0fc7ea11271c1999460d9bf194faf565451ed4219", "ja": "ゲーム系の資料集めは、百合子に一任するよ。\n理解度が高いのは間違いないだろうし。", "zh": "收集游戏方面的资料就全权交给百合子了。\n她的理解能力肯定很强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "88396d767705c6132e9be4347fd52d59b10250623c352418391f4206155dd52b", "ja": "わかりました！　それじゃあ、\n私のオススメを厳選してきますね！", "zh": "明白了！那么，\n我会精心挑选出我的推荐作品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1043_005yay", "source_sha256": "25c50b4036f20f6d705800d6498084d07211faedf4da51cec28bed1227e2b0c3", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！\n百合子さん！", "zh": "请多关照！\n百合子小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0226_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "9852c8056361b52746c8f6742b2556e431fcb60b79692f822e2cdd10760026d6", "ja": "（さて、みんなこの楽曲にどう取り組んでいくか……\nこっちも気合いを入れてサポートしないとな！）", "zh": "（那么，大家要怎样投入这首歌呢……\n我这边也得打起精神来好好支持才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
